      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reachability Analysis",
      "bbox": [
        199.54100036621094,
        88.44384765625,
        412.46221923828125,
        109.81965637207031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mahmoud Selim1, Amr Alanwar2, Shreyas Kousik3, Grace Gao3, Marco Pavone3, and Karl H. Johansson4",
      "bbox": [
        55.51899719238281,
        124.38079833984375,
        536.8021240234375,
        136.2381591796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abstract—Reinforcement learning (RL) is capable of sophis-",
      "bbox": [
        58.927001953125,
        177.80323791503906,
        300.02337646484375,
        185.86402893066406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ticated motion planning and control for robots in uncertain",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        187.76625061035156,
        300.023193359375,
        195.82704162597656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "environments. However, state-of-the-art deep RL approaches",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        197.7282257080078,
        300.0231628417969,
        205.7890167236328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "typically lack safety guarantees, especially when the robot and",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        207.6912384033203,
        300.02313232421875,
        215.7520294189453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "environment models are unknown. To justify widespread deploy-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        217.6542510986328,
        300.0232238769531,
        225.7150421142578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ment, robots must respect safety constraints without sacriﬁcing",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        227.61622619628906,
        300.023193359375,
        235.67701721191406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "performance. Thus, we propose a Black-box Reachability-based",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        237.57923889160156,
        300.0231628417969,
        245.64002990722656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Safety Layer (BRSL) with three main components: (1) data-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        247.54225158691406,
        300.0231628417969,
        255.60304260253906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "driven reachability analysis for a black-box robot model, (2) a",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        257.50421142578125,
        300.023193359375,
        265.56500244140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "trajectory rollout planner that predicts future actions and obser-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        267.46722412109375,
        300.0231628417969,
        275.52801513671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "vations using an ensemble of neural networks trained online,",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        277.43023681640625,
        300.0232238769531,
        285.49102783203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and (3) a differentiable polytope collision check between the",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        287.3922424316406,
        300.023193359375,
        295.45306396484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reachable set and obstacles that enables correcting unsafe actions.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        297.3552551269531,
        300.023193359375,
        305.41607666015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In simulation, BRSL outperforms other state-of-the-art safe RL",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        307.3182678222656,
        300.0232238769531,
        315.37908935546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "methods on a Turtlebot 3, a quadrotor, a trajectory-tracking",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        317.2802734375,
        300.023193359375,
        325.341064453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "point mass, and a hexarotor in wind with an unsafe set adjacent",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        327.2432861328125,
        300.023193359375,
        335.3040771484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to the area of highest reward.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        337.2052917480469,
        166.80044555664062,
        345.26611328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Index Terms—Reinforcement Learning, Robot Safety, Task and",
      "bbox": [
        58.927005767822266,
        352.41729736328125,
        300.0223388671875,
        360.47808837890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Motion Planning",
      "bbox": [
        48.9640007019043,
        362.38031005859375,
        114.6070327758789,
        370.44110107421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I. INTRODUCTION",
      "bbox": [
        135.6199951171875,
        379.23651123046875,
        213.3717803955078,
        388.14306640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In reinforcement learning (RL), an agent perceives and",
      "bbox": [
        58.92699432373047,
        394.8865051269531,
        300.02191162109375,
        403.7930603027344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reacts to consecutive states of its environment to maximize",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        406.84149169921875,
        300.02154541015625,
        415.748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "long-term cumulative expected reward [1]. One key challenge",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        418.7974853515625,
        300.021484375,
        427.70404052734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to the widespread deployment of RL in safety-critical systems",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        430.7524719238281,
        300.02154541015625,
        439.6590270996094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is ensuring that an RL agent’s policies are safe, especially",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        442.70745849609375,
        300.02154541015625,
        451.614013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "when the system environment or dynamics are a black box",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        454.6624450683594,
        300.0214538574219,
        463.5690002441406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and subject to noise [2], [3]. In this work, we consider",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        466.617431640625,
        300.0215148925781,
        475.52398681640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "RL for guaranteed-safe navigation of mobile robots, such",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        478.5724182128906,
        300.0215148925781,
        487.4789733886719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "as autonomous cars or delivery drones, where safety means",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        490.5284118652344,
        300.0215148925781,
        499.4349670410156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "collision avoidance. We leverage RL to plan complex action",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        502.4833984375,
        300.021484375,
        511.38995361328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sequences in concert with data-driven reachability analysis to",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        514.4383544921875,
        300.0215148925781,
        523.3449096679688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "guarantee safety for a black-box system.",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        526.3933715820312,
        214.9608154296875,
        535.2999267578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A. Related Work",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        540.1410522460938,
        117.10816192626953,
        548.7288208007812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Safe RL aims to learn policies that maximize expected",
      "bbox": [
        58.92699432373047,
        554.7053833007812,
        300.0219421386719,
        563.6119384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reward on a task while respecting safety constraints during",
      "bbox": [
        48.963993072509766,
        566.661376953125,
        300.021484375,
        575.5679321289062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
