        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Digital Object Identiﬁer (DOI): see top of this page",
      "bbox": [
        56.93396759033203,
        740.479248046875,
        227.11151123046875,
        747.6045532226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fig. 1: Overview of the proposed BRSL method (link to video). Given data collected",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        306.41375732421875,
        563.0349731445312,
        312.6483459472656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ofﬂine (in yellow, right), we perform online safe training and deployment of an RL agent.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        314.3837585449219,
        563.0350341796875,
        320.61834716796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The RL agent creates trajectory plans for a robot in a receding-horizon way as follows.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        322.353759765625,
        563.0350341796875,
        328.5883483886719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each planning iteration is one clockwise loop in the green dashed box. First (blue, top",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        330.3237609863281,
        563.0349731445312,
        336.558349609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "left), the agent predicts a possible future trajectory by rolling out its current policy",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        338.29376220703125,
        563.034912109375,
        344.5283508300781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "with an ensemble of neural networks trained online to model the black-box environment",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        346.2637634277344,
        563.0347900390625,
        352.49835205078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(grey, bottom left). Second (orange, middle), the candidate plan is adjusted to ensure",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        354.2347717285156,
        563.0350341796875,
        360.4693603515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "safety using data-driven reachability and a constrained, differentiable method of collision-",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        362.20477294921875,
        563.034912109375,
        368.4393615722656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "checking our robot’s reachable sets. We execute a failsafe maneuver if the collision check",
      "bbox": [
