        370.1747741699219,
        563.0350341796875,
        376.40936279296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is infeasible. Finally, the new safe plan is passed to the robot, and a penalty is passed",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        378.144775390625,
        563.0350341796875,
        384.3793640136719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
